  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: 21.3333px;\">(20 fotos) El centro de medicina est&eacute;tica, deporte y salud &Aacute;gora, en la avenida Montendre, 36 de Onda, antigua Aleya, ha cambiado de gerencia, ahora a cargo definitivamente de Rub&eacute;n Carratal&aacute; Cerezo y Mar&iacute;a Amparo Gimeno Romero (en la foto, de negro), que apuestan por una belleza saludable y por unos excelentes tratamientos deportivos. Su tel&eacute;fono, 964 60 08 85.</span></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pilatesembarassadesiagora/p1360752.jpg\" alt=\"p1360752\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pilatesembarassadesiagora/p1360753.jpg\" alt=\"p1360753\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pilatesembarassadesiagora/p1360754.jpg\" alt=\"p1360754\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pilatesembarassadesiagora/p1360755.jpg\" alt=\"p1360755\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pilatesembarassadesiagora/p1360756.jpg\" alt=\"p1360756\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pilatesembarassadesiagora/p1360757.jpg\" alt=\"p1360757\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pilatesembarassadesiagora/p1360758.jpg\" alt=\"p1360758\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pilatesembarassadesiagora/p1360759.jpg\" alt=\"p1360759\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/pilatesembarassadesiagora/p136